Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: Modern package manager for @FLAVOR@ jailbreaks
 Browse your repositories, install and remove packages, keep tweaks updated
 and read every depiction, on iPhone and iPad. The app runs without root;
 installs go through a small on-demand root daemon whose helper installs
 packages natively and registers apps with LaunchServices itself. No dpkg,
 no uicache.
